Object.assign(window.__CMPDATA__=window.__CMPDATA__||{},{"databricks__16": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">公开客户：AT&amp;T、Block、Rivian、Walgreens、Mercedes-Benz、Shell、Siemens、Toyota、Warner Bros. Discovery；国内出海与跨国企业采用多 社区共识。 互联网/AI 公司是基本盘：MosaicML 被收购前就是客户，收购后成为 Mosaic AI 底座 社区共识。 采用模…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>公开客户：AT&amp;T、Block、Rivian、Walgreens、Mercedes-Benz、Shell、Siemens、Toyota、Warner Bros. Discovery；国内出海与跨国企业采用多 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>互联网/AI 公司是基本盘：MosaicML 被收购前就是客户，收购后成为 Mosaic AI 底座 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>采用模式常见：Databricks 做 ingestion/特征/训练，BI 层接 Power BI 或 Snowflake（双平台并存很常见）<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (AT&amp;T, Shell, Toyota and cross-industry others). Public customers: AT&amp;T, Block, Rivian, Walgreens, Mercedes-Benz, Shell, Siemens, Toyota, Warner Bros. Discovery…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (AT&amp;T, Shell, Toyota and cross-industry others).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Public customers: AT&amp;T, Block, Rivian, Walgreens, Mercedes-Benz, Shell, Siemens, Toyota, Warner Bros. Discovery; strong adoption among multinationals and companies expanding overseas <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Internet/AI companies are the home turf: MosaicML was a customer before the acquisition and became the Mosaic AI foundation after it <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Common pattern: Databricks for ingestion/features/training, BI served from Power BI or Snowflake — dual-platform coexistence is normal <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__17": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">IaC：官方 Terraform Provider（工作区、集群、UC 权限、Job 全可代码化）；CI/CD 接 GitHub Actions/Azure DevOps 社区共识。 数据栈：dbt-databricks 适配器、Airflow Provider、Fivetran/Airbyte 等 ingestion 工具官方 conn…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>IaC：官方 Terraform Provider（工作区、集群、UC 权限、Job 全可代码化）；CI/CD 接 GitHub Actions/Azure DevOps <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>数据栈：dbt-databricks 适配器、Airflow Provider、Fivetran/Airbyte 等 ingestion 工具官方 connector <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>ML：MLflow（Databricks 创始捐献）实验跟踪 + 模型注册 + Model Serving 一条龙 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Terraform/dbt/Airflow/MLflow fully covered). IaC: official Terraform provider (workspaces, clusters, UC grants, jobs — all as code); CI/CD via GitHub Actions /…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Terraform/dbt/Airflow/MLflow fully covered).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>IaC: official Terraform provider (workspaces, clusters, UC grants, jobs — all as code); CI/CD via GitHub Actions / Azure DevOps <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Data stack: dbt-databricks adapter, Airflow provider, official connectors for Fivetran/Airbyte-class ingestion tools <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>ML: MLflow (donated by Databricks&#x27; founders) for experiment tracking + model registry + Model Serving end to end <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__18": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">三云全覆盖：AWS / Azure（Azure Databricks 为微软一等集成）/ GCP；不支持私有化部署，专有云/本地机房只能走混合架构 官方文档。 Serverless SQL 仓库与 Serverless 计算：免集群运维、快速启停、按量计费；经典集群仍可用于需要深度定制（VPC 注入、特殊实例）的场景 官方文档。 成本注意…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>三云全覆盖：AWS / Azure（Azure Databricks 为微软一等集成）/ GCP；不支持私有化部署，专有云/本地机房只能走混合架构 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Serverless SQL 仓库与 Serverless 计算：免集群运维、快速启停、按量计费；经典集群仍可用于需要深度定制（VPC 注入、特殊实例）的场景 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>成本注意：Serverless 单价高于经典 DBU，省的是运维与空转，不是单价；选型要按负载画像算总账 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (it is itself the cloud service; Serverless is the strategic default). All three clouds: AWS / Azure (Azure Databricks is a first-class Microsoft integration) /…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (it is itself the cloud service; Serverless is the strategic default).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>All three clouds: AWS / Azure (Azure Databricks is a first-class Microsoft integration) / GCP; no private/on-premises deployment — regulated on-prem scenarios need a hybrid architecture <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Serverless SQL warehouses and serverless compute: no cluster ops, fast start/stop, usage billing; classic clusters remain for deep customization (VPC injection, special instance types) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cost note: Serverless unit price exceeds classic DBUs — it saves ops and idle time, not unit price; choose by workload profile and do the total math <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__19": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Auto Loader（cloudFiles）：增量检测新文件落盘（S3/ADLS/GCS），schema 推断与演进，是&quot;文件进湖&quot;事实标准 官方文档。 COPY INTO：SQL 一次性/幂等批量加载；Delta Live Tables（现 Lakeflow Declarative Pipelines）：声明式 ETL，流批统一，内建…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Auto Loader（cloudFiles）：增量检测新文件落盘（S3/ADLS/GCS），schema 推断与演进，是&quot;文件进湖&quot;事实标准 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>COPY INTO：SQL 一次性/幂等批量加载；Delta Live Tables（现 Lakeflow Declarative Pipelines）：声明式 ETL，流批统一，内建数据质量期望（EXPECTATIONS）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>流式：Spark Structured Streaming 直连 Kafka/Event Hubs/Kinesis，端到端 exactly-once 语义 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>边缘：小文件碎片是湖仓通病，Auto Loader + OPTIMIZE/Z-ORDER 是标准治理动作；schema 漂移处理要显式设计 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Auto Loader + COPY INTO + DLT unified batch/streaming). Auto Loader (cloudFiles): incrementally detects new files landing in S3/ADLS/GCS with schema inference …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Auto Loader + COPY INTO + DLT unified batch/streaming).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Auto Loader (cloudFiles): incrementally detects new files landing in S3/ADLS/GCS with schema inference and evolution — the de-facto &quot;files into the lake&quot; standard <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>COPY INTO: idempotent SQL bulk loads; Delta Live Tables (now Lakeflow Declarative Pipelines): declarative ETL unifying batch and streaming with built-in data-quality expectations <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Streaming: Spark Structured Streaming straight into Kafka/Event Hubs/Kinesis with end-to-end exactly-once semantics <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Edge: small-file fragmentation is the chronic lakehouse disease — Auto Loader plus OPTIMIZE/Z-ORDER is the standard regimen; schema drift needs explicit design <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__2": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">审计日志记录工作区操作、数据访问、权限变更等事件，可投递到客户 S3/ADLS（建议配对象锁定防篡改）再接入 Splunk/Datadog 官方文档。 Unity Catalog 的 system.access.audit 系统表可 SQL 直接查&quot;谁在何时访问了哪张表&quot;，是数据访问审计的主入口 官方文档。 注意：审计日志投递与保留策略要…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>审计日志记录工作区操作、数据访问、权限变更等事件，可投递到客户 S3/ADLS（建议配对象锁定防篡改）再接入 Splunk/Datadog <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Unity Catalog 的 <code>system.access.audit</code> 系统表可 SQL 直接查&quot;谁在何时访问了哪张表&quot;，是数据访问审计的主入口 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>注意：审计日志投递与保留策略要自己配；老工作区若未启用 Unity Catalog，表级审计粒度会打折 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (audit logs + system.access.audit). Audit logs capture workspace operations, data access and permission changes, deliverable to customer S3/ADLS (object lock re…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (audit logs + system.access.audit).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Audit logs capture workspace operations, data access and permission changes, deliverable to customer S3/ADLS (object lock recommended for tamper resistance) and onward to Splunk/Datadog <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Unity Catalog&#x27;s <code>system.access.audit</code> table answers &quot;who accessed which table when&quot; directly in SQL — the primary data-access audit surface <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Caveat: log delivery and retention policies are yours to configure; on legacy workspaces without Unity Catalog, table-level audit granularity is weaker <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__20": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">对外共享：Delta Sharing 开放协议，把实时 Delta 表安全共享给外部组织，对方用任意引擎（Spark/Pandas/Power BI）读，无需复制数据 官方文档。 对内联邦：Lakehouse Federation 建外部连接（Connection）+ 外部目录（Foreign Catalog），直接查询 PostgreS…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>对外共享：Delta Sharing 开放协议，把实时 Delta 表安全共享给外部组织，对方用任意引擎（Spark/Pandas/Power BI）读，无需复制数据 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>对内联邦：Lakehouse Federation 建外部连接（Connection）+ 外部目录（Foreign Catalog），直接查询 PostgreSQL/MySQL/Snowflake/BigQuery 等源，查询下推到源端执行，走 Unity Catalog 统一鉴权审计 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>边界：联邦查询适合即席探索与小结果集；大体量反复扫描、高频生产查询仍建议先入湖（延迟与源端负载不可控）；跨云 egress 费用自理 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Delta Sharing for outbound; Lakehouse Federation for inbound queries). Outbound sharing: the Delta Sharing open protocol securely shares live Delta tables with…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Delta Sharing for outbound; Lakehouse Federation for inbound queries).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Outbound sharing: the Delta Sharing open protocol securely shares live Delta tables with external organizations — recipients read with any engine (Spark/pandas/Power BI), no data copying <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Inbound federation: Lakehouse Federation creates external Connections + Foreign Catalogs to query PostgreSQL/MySQL/Snowflake/BigQuery in place, with pushdown to the source and unified Unity Catalog auth/audit <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Boundary: federation suits ad-hoc exploration and small result sets; repeated large scans and high-frequency production queries should still land in the lake first (latency and source load are uncontrollable); cross-cloud egress is on you <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__21": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Delta Change Data Feed（CDF）：表级开启后，下游可增量读取行的插入/更新/删除变更，是湖内 CDC 标准机制 官方文档。 DLT/Lakeflow 管道：APPLY CHANGES INTO 语法直接消费上游 CDC 做 SCD Type 1/2 拉链 官方文档。 新方向：Lakebase（Databricks 的…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Delta Change Data Feed（CDF）：表级开启后，下游可增量读取行的插入/更新/删除变更，是湖内 CDC 标准机制 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>DLT/Lakeflow 管道：<code>APPLY CHANGES INTO</code> 语法直接消费上游 CDC 做 SCD Type 1/2 拉链 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>新方向：Lakebase（Databricks 的 Postgres 兼容 OLTP）→ Delta 的 Lakehouse Sync 原生 CDC，无需外部作业即可把操作库变更流进数仓 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>下游：出湖仓可经 Delta Sharing、JDBC/ODBC、或写回 Kafka/对象存储；CDC 链路延迟通常在秒到分钟级，不是毫秒级同步 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Delta CDF + DLT + Lakebase Sync). Delta Change Data Feed (CDF): enable per table and downstream consumers incrementally read row-level inserts/updates/deletes …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Delta CDF + DLT + Lakebase Sync).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Delta Change Data Feed (CDF): enable per table and downstream consumers incrementally read row-level inserts/updates/deletes — the in-lake CDC standard <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>DLT/Lakeflow pipelines: <code>APPLY CHANGES INTO</code> consumes upstream CDC directly into SCD Type 1/2 historization <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>New direction: Lakebase (Databricks&#x27; Postgres-compatible OLTP) to Delta via Lakehouse Sync — native CDC streaming operational changes into the warehouse with no external jobs <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>Downstream: exit via Delta Sharing, JDBC/ODBC, or write-back to Kafka/object storage; CDC pipeline latency is typically seconds to minutes, not millisecond sync <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__22": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Delta 表可设保留期，VACUUM 按保留期清理旧文件版本 官方文档。 流式表/物化视图的增量过期逻辑需自己写清理任务 官方文档。 VACUUM 默认 7 天保留期防并发读写冲突，调小有风险 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Delta 表可设保留期，VACUUM 按保留期清理旧文件版本 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>流式表/物化视图的增量过期逻辑需自己写清理任务 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>VACUUM 默认 7 天保留期防并发读写冲突，调小有风险 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Delta retention + VACUUM; custom cleanup for streaming). Delta tables support retention periods; VACUUM reclaims old file versions per retention (official docs…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Delta retention + VACUUM; custom cleanup for streaming).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Delta tables support retention periods; VACUUM reclaims old file versions per retention <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Streaming tables/materialized views need custom cleanup jobs for expiry logic <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>VACUUM defaults to 7-day retention to protect concurrent readers; lowering it is risky <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__23": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">只改定义：加列走 mergeSchema/schema evolution，流批写入不中断；启用 column mapping 后改名/删列是纯元数据操作，不重写 Parquet 文件 官方文档。 重写数据但住哪不变：兼容类型放宽（INT→LONG 等）需开启 delta.enableTypeWidening 特性（Delta 3.2+/…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>只改定义：加列走 mergeSchema/schema evolution，流批写入不中断；启用 column mapping 后改名/删列是纯元数据操作，不重写 Parquet 文件 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>重写数据但住哪不变：兼容类型放宽（INT→LONG 等）需开启 delta.enableTypeWidening 特性（Delta 3.2+/4.0）才是元数据操作；不兼容的改类型需 overwriteSchema 重写 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>搬数据：ALTER TABLE … CLUSTER BY（Liquid Clustering）本身是元数据操作、即时在线，但只影响未来写入；历史数据保持旧布局，需显式 OPTIMIZE（FULL）重写，按集群计算计费 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>验证约束：NOT NULL 与 CHECK 强制执行，违例写入直接失败；PK/FK/UNIQUE 仅信息性不强制（需 Unity Catalog 与对应 Runtime 版本），只做优化器提示与血缘 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>规模：第二、三类代价 O(n)；TB 级表 OPTIMIZE FULL 是&quot;数小时 + 集群烧钱&quot;，小表大表两个世界 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>语义：Delta 事务日志保证 DDL 单语句原子提交；读走快照隔离、写走乐观并发，DDL 不阻塞并发读写；time travel 按版本保留各自 schema，旧版本可按旧 schema 查询 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>/<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (Delta schema evolution online; type change / clustering-key change have costs). Definition-only changes: add-column goes through mergeSchema/schema e…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (Delta schema evolution online; type change / clustering-key change have costs).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Definition-only changes: add-column goes through mergeSchema/schema evolution without interrupting streaming or batch writes; with column mapping enabled, rename/drop column are pure metadata ops that never rewrite Parquet files <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Same-location rewrites: compatible type widening (INT→LONG etc.) is a metadata op only with the delta.enableTypeWidening table feature (Delta 3.2+/4.0); incompatible type changes need an overwriteSchema rewrite <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Data moves: ALTER TABLE … CLUSTER BY (Liquid Clustering) is itself a metadata op and online instantly, but it only affects future writes — existing data keeps the old layout until an explicit OPTIMIZE (FULL) rewrites it, billed as cluster compute <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Constraint validation: NOT NULL and CHECK are enforced and violating writes fail outright; PK/FK/UNIQUE are informational only (require Unity Catalog and the matching Runtime version), serving as optimizer hints and lineage <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Scale: class 2/3 costs are O(n); OPTIMIZE FULL on a TB-scale table is &quot;hours + burning cluster compute&quot; — small and huge tables are two different worlds <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Semantics: the Delta transaction log makes each DDL an atomic single-statement commit; reads use snapshot isolation and writes use optimistic concurrency, so DDL never blocks concurrent reads/writes; time travel keeps each version&#x27;s own schema, and old versions are queryable under their old schema <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> / <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__24": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">工作区、集群/ SQL Warehouse 按团队隔离，Unity Catalog 做数据权限 官方文档。 计算资源按集群/仓库隔离，noisy neighbor 天然规避 官方文档。 成本归因到工作区/集群标签，FinOps 友好 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>工作区、集群/ SQL Warehouse 按团队隔离，Unity Catalog 做数据权限 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>计算资源按集群/仓库隔离，noisy neighbor 天然规避 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>成本归因到工作区/集群标签，FinOps 友好 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Workspace/cluster isolation + Unity Catalog). Workspaces, clusters / SQL warehouses isolate teams; Unity Catalog governs data access <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Compute i…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Workspace/cluster isolation + Unity Catalog).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Workspaces, clusters / SQL warehouses isolate teams; Unity Catalog governs data access <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Compute is isolated per cluster/warehouse, sidestepping noisy neighbors <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cost attribution via workspace/cluster tags is FinOps-friendly <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__25": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">Delta Sharing 可跨区/跨云共享数据读 官方文档。 写仍是单工作区/单区，无多活写入语义 社区共识。 region 容灾靠工作区备份重建，RTO 看数据量 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Delta Sharing 可跨区/跨云共享数据读 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>写仍是单工作区/单区，无多活写入语义 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>region 容灾靠工作区备份重建，RTO 看数据量 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Delta Sharing cross-region reads; no cross-region writes). Delta Sharing shares data for reads across regions/clouds <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Writes stay single-workspac…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Delta Sharing cross-region reads; no cross-region writes).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Delta Sharing shares data for reads across regions/clouds <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Writes stay single-workspace/single-region; no active-active write semantics <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Region DR means rebuilding workspaces; RTO scales with data <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__26": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">控制平面托管高可用，计算集群故障可重建恢复 官方文档。 Delta Lake 的 ACID 让任务重跑不脏数据，RPO 靠检查点 社区共识。 SLA 是平台级，具体 RTO 看集群重建时间 厂商口径。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>控制平面托管高可用，计算集群故障可重建恢复 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Delta Lake 的 ACID 让任务重跑不脏数据，RPO 靠检查点 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>SLA 是平台级，具体 RTO 看集群重建时间 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Managed control plane; compute clusters rebuildable). Managed control plane is HA; failed compute clusters rebuild <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Delta Lake ACID keeps retries…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Managed control plane; compute clusters rebuildable).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Managed control plane is HA; failed compute clusters rebuild <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Delta Lake ACID keeps retries clean; RPO follows checkpoints <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>SLA is platform-level; actual RTO follows cluster rebuild time <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__27": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Databricks Unity Catalog 提供 Row Filters（行过滤）与 Column Masks（列掩码），SQL 定义、集中治理 官方文档 支持列级权限与动态视图 官方文档 仅 Unity Catalog 治理的表生效；外部表 / 旧 Hive metastore 路径是绕过面 社区实测</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Databricks Unity Catalog 提供 Row Filters（行过滤）与 Column Masks（列掩码），SQL 定义、集中治理 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>支持列级权限与动态视图 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>仅 Unity Catalog 治理的表生效；外部表 / 旧 Hive metastore 路径是绕过面 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Unity Catalog row filters + column masks). Databricks Unity Catalog provides Row Filters and Column Masks, defined in SQL and centrally governed (official docs…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Unity Catalog row filters + column masks).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Databricks Unity Catalog provides Row Filters and Column Masks, defined in SQL and centrally governed <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Column-level privileges and dynamic views are supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Only effective on Unity Catalog-governed tables; external tables / legacy Hive metastore paths are a bypass surface <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__28": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">VARIANT 半结构化类型（Photon），schema-on-read，自动演进 官方文档。 VARIANT 查询性能弱于规整列，热点路径建议规整化 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>VARIANT 半结构化类型（Photon），schema-on-read，自动演进 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>VARIANT 查询性能弱于规整列，热点路径建议规整化 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (VARIANT type, schema-on-read). VARIANT semi-structured type (Photon) with schema-on-read and auto-evolution <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. VARIANT queries slower than regula…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (VARIANT type, schema-on-read).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>VARIANT semi-structured type (Photon) with schema-on-read and auto-evolution <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>VARIANT queries slower than regular columns; normalize hot paths <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__29": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">Databricks SQL 无传统全文索引 官方文档。 文本检索靠向量搜索/AI 检索，关键词精确检索弱 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Databricks SQL 无传统全文索引 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>文本检索靠向量搜索/AI 检索，关键词精确检索弱 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">No native</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (No native FTS; AI search separate). No classic full-text indexes in Databricks SQL <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Text search via vector/AI retrieval; keyword-exact search is …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (No native FTS; AI search separate).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No classic full-text indexes in Databricks SQL <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Text search via vector/AI retrieval; keyword-exact search is weak <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__3": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">身份：SSO（SAML/OIDC）、MFA、SCIM 用户同步；自动化用 Service Principal 而非个人账号 官方文档。 授权：Unity Catalog 三级命名空间（catalog.schema.table）统一管表、文件（Volume）、模型、函数乃至 AI Agent 的权限；支持行级安全、列掩码、动态视图 官方文档…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>身份：SSO（SAML/OIDC）、MFA、SCIM 用户同步；自动化用 Service Principal 而非个人账号 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>授权：Unity Catalog 三级命名空间（catalog.schema.table）统一管表、文件（Volume）、模型、函数乃至 AI Agent 的权限；支持行级安全、列掩码、动态视图 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>遗留坑：2023 年前建的老工作区可能是 Hive Metastore 模式，权限是另一套；迁移到 Unity Catalog 是生产合规的必经之路，迁移本身有工作量 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (SSO + fine-grained Unity Catalog RBAC). Identity: SSO (SAML/OIDC), MFA, SCIM user sync; automation uses service principals, not personal accounts (official doc…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (SSO + fine-grained Unity Catalog RBAC).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Identity: SSO (SAML/OIDC), MFA, SCIM user sync; automation uses service principals, not personal accounts <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Authorization: Unity Catalog&#x27;s three-level namespace (catalog.schema.table) governs tables, files (Volumes), models, functions and even AI agents under one model; row-level security, column masking and dynamic views supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Legacy trap: workspaces created before ~2023 may run the Hive Metastore permission model, which is a different system; migrating to Unity Catalog is real project work and effectively mandatory for compliance-grade production <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__30": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Delta Lake 基于 Parquet 列存，默认 ZSTD/Snappy 压缩，压缩比高。官方文档 Photon 引擎与自动 OPTIMIZE（Z-Order、自动压缩）进一步提升存储与查询效率。官方文档 开放格式下压缩参数用户可调，透明度高于纯黑盒云数仓。社区实测</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Delta Lake 基于 Parquet 列存，默认 ZSTD/Snappy 压缩，压缩比高。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Photon 引擎与自动 OPTIMIZE（Z-Order、自动压缩）进一步提升存储与查询效率。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>开放格式下压缩参数用户可调，透明度高于纯黑盒云数仓。<span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Delta columnar with ZSTD plus auto-optimization). Delta Lake is Parquet-based columnar with default ZSTD/Snappy compression and high ratios. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> Th…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Delta columnar with ZSTD plus auto-optimization).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Delta Lake is Parquet-based columnar with default ZSTD/Snappy compression and high ratios. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>The Photon engine and auto-OPTIMIZE (Z-Order, auto-compaction) further improve storage and query efficiency. <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n<li>With open formats, compression parameters are user-tunable — more transparent than black-box cloud warehouses. <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__31": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">Delta Lake、Spark 等核心技术开源（Apache 2.0），数据以开放格式（Delta/Parquet）存储，可迁出。官方文档 Databricks 平台（Runtime 优化、Unity Catalog、AI 功能）为闭源，深度使用后存在平台绑定。厂商口径 开放格式是实质缓解：数据本身不被锁定，锁定的是计算与治理层。社区共…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Delta Lake、Spark 等核心技术开源（Apache 2.0），数据以开放格式（Delta/Parquet）存储，可迁出。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Databricks 平台（Runtime 优化、Unity Catalog、AI 功能）为闭源，深度使用后存在平台绑定。<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n<li>开放格式是实质缓解：数据本身不被锁定，锁定的是计算与治理层。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Delta/Spark open; platform closed). Core technologies (Delta Lake, Spark) are open source (Apache 2.0); data lives in open formats (Delta/Parquet) and can leave.…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Delta/Spark open; platform closed).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Core technologies (Delta Lake, Spark) are open source (Apache 2.0); data lives in open formats (Delta/Parquet) and can leave. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>The Databricks platform (Runtime optimizations, Unity Catalog, AI features) is closed source; deep use creates platform binding. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n<li>Open formats are real mitigation: the data itself is not locked in — the compute and governance layers are. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__32": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Photon 引擎 + Spark CBO，自适应查询执行（AQE）运行时调优 官方文档。 支持 Spark SQL hint 干预计划 官方文档。 计划翻转少于传统数仓，但 AQE 行为不透明难排查 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Photon 引擎 + Spark CBO，自适应查询执行（AQE）运行时调优 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>支持 Spark SQL hint 干预计划 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>计划翻转少于传统数仓，但 AQE 行为不透明难排查 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Photon + CBO + AQE; Spark hints available). Photon engine + Spark CBO with adaptive query execution (AQE) runtime tuning <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Spark SQL hints can s…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Photon + CBO + AQE; Spark hints available).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Photon engine + Spark CBO with adaptive query execution (AQE) runtime tuning <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Spark SQL hints can steer plans <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Fewer flips than legacy warehouses, but opaque AQE behavior is hard to debug <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__33": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Photon 自动向量化，Liquid Clustering 自动数据布局，调参极少 官方文档。 自动优化（auto optimize/compaction）后台进行 官方文档。 集群规格选择仍是成本主因 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Photon 自动向量化，Liquid Clustering 自动数据布局，调参极少 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>自动优化（auto optimize/compaction）后台进行 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>集群规格选择仍是成本主因 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Strong autonomy: Photon + auto liquid clustering). Photon auto-vectorizes; Liquid Clustering auto-manages layout; minimal knobs <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Auto-optimize/…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Strong autonomy: Photon + auto liquid clustering).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Photon auto-vectorizes; Liquid Clustering auto-manages layout; minimal knobs <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Auto-optimize/compaction runs in the background <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cluster sizing remains the main cost lever <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__34": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">数据文件落云对象存储，完整性依赖云厂商底层校验与冗余。厂商口径 Delta Lake 提供事务日志与版本化，逻辑损坏可回滚版本，但非静默位损坏检测。官方文档 无用户可配的页/块校验开关，损坏审计依赖云厂商。待验证</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>数据文件落云对象存储，完整性依赖云厂商底层校验与冗余。<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n<li>Delta Lake 提供事务日志与版本化，逻辑损坏可回滚版本，但非静默位损坏检测。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>无用户可配的页/块校验开关，损坏审计依赖云厂商。<span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Cloud storage checks; no user switch). Data files sit on cloud object storage; integrity depends on provider-level checks and redundancy. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span> Delta La…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Cloud storage checks; no user switch).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Data files sit on cloud object storage; integrity depends on provider-level checks and redundancy. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n<li>Delta Lake provides transaction logs and versioning, so logical corruption can roll back, but silent bit-rot detection is not its job. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>No user-configurable page/block checksum switch; corruption auditing depends on the provider. <code>(to be verified)</code></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__35": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">无传统存储过程；靠 Notebooks/Workflows 编排，DBSQL 有脚本能力 官方文档。 去 O 迁移时 PL/SQL 逻辑需重写为作业流 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>无传统存储过程；靠 Notebooks/Workflows 编排，DBSQL 有脚本能力 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>去 O 迁移时 PL/SQL 逻辑需重写为作业流 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Scripts/workflows; no classic SPs). No classic stored procedures; orchestration via Notebooks/Workflows <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Oracle PL/SQL logic must be rewritten as…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Scripts/workflows; no classic SPs).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No classic stored procedures; orchestration via Notebooks/Workflows <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Oracle PL/SQL logic must be rewritten as job flows <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__36": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">Delta 支持 NOT NULL/CHECK（有限），主键/外键为信息性不强制 官方文档。 完整性靠写入链路（DLT expectations）保证 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Delta 支持 NOT NULL/CHECK（有限），主键/外键为信息性不强制 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>完整性靠写入链路（DLT expectations）保证 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Limited Delta constraints). Delta has limited NOT NULL/CHECK; PK/FK informational, not enforced <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Integrity via ingestion (DLT expectations) (offi…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Limited Delta constraints).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Delta has limited NOT NULL/CHECK; PK/FK informational, not enforced <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Integrity via ingestion (DLT expectations) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__37": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Spark SQL 窗口函数、CTE 完备，分析函数丰富 官方文档。 递归 CTE 支持有限，复杂递归改写为迭代作业 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Spark SQL 窗口函数、CTE 完备，分析函数丰富 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>递归 CTE 支持有限，复杂递归改写为迭代作业 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Strong Spark SQL windows/CTEs). Strong Spark SQL window functions and CTEs <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Recursive CTEs limited; rewrite complex recursion as iterative jobs…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Strong Spark SQL windows/CTEs).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Strong Spark SQL window functions and CTEs <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Recursive CTEs limited; rewrite complex recursion as iterative jobs <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__38": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">Delta Lake 的 Time Travel 使被删数据在保留期（默认 7 天）内可恢复；VACUUM 可清旧文件但有最小保留限制 官方文档 VACUUM 默认阻止删除 7 天内的文件，“立即擦除”需调参并承担破坏并发读取的风险 官方文档 备份、Delta Sharing 共享副本延长残留面 社区共识 无原生擦除证明 社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Delta Lake 的 Time Travel 使被删数据在保留期（默认 7 天）内可恢复；VACUUM 可清旧文件但有最小保留限制 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>VACUUM 默认阻止删除 7 天内的文件，“立即擦除”需调参并承担破坏并发读取的风险 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>备份、Delta Sharing 共享副本延长残留面 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>无原生擦除证明 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Delta Time Travel keeps deleted history). Delta Lake Time Travel keeps deleted data recoverable within retention (default 7 days); VACUUM clears old files but ha…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Delta Time Travel keeps deleted history).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Delta Lake Time Travel keeps deleted data recoverable within retention (default 7 days); VACUUM clears old files but has minimum-retention guards <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>VACUUM refuses to remove files newer than 7 days by default; immediate erasure needs tuning and risks breaking concurrent readers <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Backups and Delta Sharing shared copies extend the residue surface <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>No native erasure attestation <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__39": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Unity Catalog 提供表/列级血缘、数据发现，自动采集 官方文档。 血缘覆盖 notebook/作业/SQL 全链路 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Unity Catalog 提供表/列级血缘、数据发现，自动采集 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>血缘覆盖 notebook/作业/SQL 全链路 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Unity Catalog native column-level lineage). Unity Catalog provides table/column-level lineage and discovery, auto-captured <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Lineage spans noteb…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Unity Catalog native column-level lineage).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Unity Catalog provides table/column-level lineage and discovery, auto-captured <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Lineage spans notebooks, jobs, and SQL end to end <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__4": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">Delta Lake 自带时间旅行（Time Travel）：可按版本号/时间戳查询历史快照，误删/误写后可回滚到历史版本 官方文档。 CLONE（浅/深克隆）可快速复制表做恢复演练或测试环境；VACUUM 控制历史保留期 官方文档。 但没有传统数据库式的&quot;全库备份/时间点恢复&quot;一键方案：数据在客户云存储上，备份策略（跨区复制、生命周期）…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Delta Lake 自带时间旅行（Time Travel）：可按版本号/时间戳查询历史快照，误删/误写后可回滚到历史版本 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li><code>CLONE</code>（浅/深克隆）可快速复制表做恢复演练或测试环境；VACUUM 控制历史保留期 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>但没有传统数据库式的&quot;全库备份/时间点恢复&quot;一键方案：数据在客户云存储上，备份策略（跨区复制、生命周期）要按云厂商最佳实践自己做；工作区配置（Job 定义、权限）的备份靠 Terraform/导出 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (Delta time travel + clone; no traditional backup). Delta Lake time travel: query historical snapshots by version or timestamp, roll back from acciden…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (Delta time travel + clone; no traditional backup).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Delta Lake time travel: query historical snapshots by version or timestamp, roll back from accidental deletes/writes <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li><code>CLONE</code> (shallow/deep) duplicates tables fast for recovery rehearsals or test environments; VACUUM governs history retention <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>But there is no one-click &quot;full backup / point-in-time restore&quot; in the traditional database sense: data lives in customer cloud storage, so backup strategy (cross-region replication, lifecycle) follows cloud best practices and is yours to build; workspace configuration (job definitions, grants) is backed up via Terraform/exports <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__40": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（存算分离：云存储+弹性集群）</span><p class=\"snippet\">数据存云对象存储，计算集群弹性启停、独立扩缩 官方文档。 Serverless SQL 仓库进一步解耦 官方文档。 跨云账户存储访问需网络配置 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>数据存云对象存储，计算集群弹性启停、独立扩缩 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Serverless SQL 仓库进一步解耦 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>跨云账户存储访问需网络配置 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Disaggregated: cloud storage + elastic clusters). Data on cloud object storage; compute clusters start/stop and scale independently <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Serverless…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Disaggregated: cloud storage + elastic clusters).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Data on cloud object storage; compute clusters start/stop and scale independently <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Serverless SQL warehouses decouple further <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cross-account storage access needs network setup <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__41": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Delta Lake：结构化、半结构化 JSON、Vector Search、MLflow 模型 官方文档。 无原生图/全文检索引擎 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Delta Lake：结构化、半结构化 JSON、Vector Search、MLflow 模型 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无原生图/全文检索引擎 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Delta multi-model: relational + JSON + vectors + ML). Delta Lake: structured, semi-structured JSON, Vector Search, MLflow models <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No native gra…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Delta multi-model: relational + JSON + vectors + ML).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Delta Lake: structured, semi-structured JSON, Vector Search, MLflow models <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No native graph/full-text engine <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__42": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">按 DBU（Databricks Unit）计量，支持按工作区/集群/作业归因用量。官方文档 预算策略（budget policies）可限自定义标签的支出上限，超限告警。官方文档 账单可导出做 FinOps 分析，是湖仓场景的成本可观测标杆之一。社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>按 DBU（Databricks Unit）计量，支持按工作区/集群/作业归因用量。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>预算策略（budget policies）可限自定义标签的支出上限，超限告警。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>账单可导出做 FinOps 分析，是湖仓场景的成本可观测标杆之一。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (DBU metering, budget policies, tags). Metered in DBUs (Databricks Units) with usage attribution by workspace, cluster, and job. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> Budget policies…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (DBU metering, budget policies, tags).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Metered in DBUs (Databricks Units) with usage attribution by workspace, cluster, and job. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Budget policies cap spend on custom tags with over-limit alerts. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Exportable billing supports FinOps analysis; a cost-observability benchmark for lakehouse workloads. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__43": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">官方 JDBC/ODBC（Simba）、databricks-sql-connector（Python）官方文档。 BI 工具生态（dbt/PowerBI/Tableau）完备 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>官方 JDBC/ODBC（Simba）、databricks-sql-connector（Python）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>BI 工具生态（dbt/PowerBI/Tableau）完备 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (JDBC/ODBC + Python connector + Spark). Official JDBC/ODBC (Simba), databricks-sql-connector (Python) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Full BI ecosystem (dbt/PowerBI/Tableau) (…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (JDBC/ODBC + Python connector + Spark).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Official JDBC/ODBC (Simba), databricks-sql-connector (Python) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Full BI ecosystem (dbt/PowerBI/Tableau) <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__44": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（物化视图+DLT，增量自动刷新）</span><p class=\"snippet\">Databricks SQL 物化视图与 DLT 管道，增量刷新、查询自动改写 官方文档。 刷新按计算资源计费，频繁刷新小表注意成本 厂商口径。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Databricks SQL 物化视图与 DLT 管道，增量刷新、查询自动改写 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>刷新按计算资源计费，频繁刷新小表注意成本 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (MVs + DLT, incremental refresh). SQL materialized views and DLT pipelines with incremental refresh and auto rewrite <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Refresh billed on compute;…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (MVs + DLT, incremental refresh).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>SQL materialized views and DLT pipelines with incremental refresh and auto rewrite <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Refresh billed on compute; watch cost on frequently refreshed small tables <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__45": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">同一平台横跨 AWS/Azure/GCP，是其核心卖点 官方文档。 Delta Sharing 可跨云共享数据 官方文档。 跨云有数据传输费，大表要算账 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>同一平台横跨 AWS/Azure/GCP，是其核心卖点 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Delta Sharing 可跨云共享数据 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>跨云有数据传输费，大表要算账 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Native on AWS/Azure/GCP). One platform spanning AWS/Azure/GCP — a core selling point <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Delta Sharing shares data across clouds <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Native on AWS/Azure/GCP).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>One platform spanning AWS/Azure/GCP — a core selling point <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Delta Sharing shares data across clouds <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cross-cloud transfer fees apply; do the math on huge tables <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__46": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">并发原语为 Delta Lake 乐观并发：写者各自基于快照准备变更，通过对 _delta_log 中编号 JSON 日志文件的原子 PUT 提交，粒度是文件/分区而非行 官方文档。 提交时若与已提交版本存在重叠数据（同行/同分区并发 MERGE），后来者提交失败并抛 ConcurrentAppendException 等冲突异常；内核不…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>并发原语为 Delta Lake 乐观并发：写者各自基于快照准备变更，通过对 <code>_delta_log</code> 中编号 JSON 日志文件的原子 PUT 提交，粒度是文件/分区而非行 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>提交时若与已提交版本存在重叠数据（同行/同分区并发 MERGE），后来者提交失败并抛 ConcurrentAppendException 等冲突异常；内核不自动重试，重试+退避必须由应用或编排器实现 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>热点打到同一分区即串行瓶颈：除胜者外所有提交全部失败重试，吞吐随冲突率线性衰减；事务日志的单点提交是全局串行化点 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>未找到官方命名或文档化的热点行机制的证据；DBR 11.x 起并发写不同分区的表不再冲突，这是通过分区设计规避冲突，而非内核打散热点 <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。</li>\n<li>推荐模式有三类：按高基数字段分区让并发作业写入不相交分区（代价是分区倾斜与 ZORDER 维护成本）、真正冲突的写用队列串行化（代价是吞吐封顶）、应用层退避重试（代价是延迟抖动）；Delta Live Tables 只是声明式微批管线，底层仍是同一套 OCC 语义，不改变点更新结论 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (optimistic concurrency fails the losing commit; the app must retry). The concurrency primitive is Delta Lake optimistic concurrency: writers prepare …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (optimistic concurrency fails the losing commit; the app must retry).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The concurrency primitive is Delta Lake optimistic concurrency: writers prepare changes against their own snapshot and commit via an atomic PUT of the numbered JSON log file into <code>_delta_log</code>; granularity is file/partition, not row <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>At commit time, if the change overlaps an already-committed version (e.g., concurrent MERGEs on the same rows/partitions), the loser&#x27;s commit fails with conflict exceptions such as ConcurrentAppendException; the kernel does not auto-retry — retry with backoff must be implemented by the application or orchestrator <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>A hotspot on one partition is a serialization bottleneck: every commit except the winner fails and retries, so throughput degrades linearly with the conflict rate; the transaction log&#x27;s single commit point is the global serialization point <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>There is no officially named or documented hotspot-row mechanism found; since DBR 11.x, concurrent writes to different partitions of a table no longer conflict — this avoids conflicts through partition design rather than kernel-level hotspot spreading (to be verified).</li>\n<li>Three recommended patterns: partition by a high-cardinality key so concurrent jobs write disjoint partitions (cost: partition skew and ZORDER maintenance), serialize genuinely conflicting writes through a queue (cost: capped throughput), and application-level backoff retry (cost: latency jitter); Delta Live Tables are declarative micro-batch pipelines on the same OCC semantics and do not change the point-update story <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__5": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">system schema 系统表极丰富：system.billing.usage（DBU 消费明细，可 join 价格表算钱）、system.access.audit（审计）、system.query.history（查询历史与耗时）官方文档。 Spark UI / Ganglia 看作业执行细节（stage、shuffle、GC）；S…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li><code>system</code> schema 系统表极丰富：<code>system.billing.usage</code>（DBU 消费明细，可 join 价格表算钱）、<code>system.access.audit</code>（审计）、<code>system.query.history</code>（查询历史与耗时）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Spark UI / Ganglia 看作业执行细节（stage、shuffle、GC）；SQL 仓库有查询历史与执行计划 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>成本可观测是刚需：DBU 只显示消费量不显示&quot;为什么&quot;，必须靠 system 表 + 打标签（tag）做分团队 chargeback，否则账单黑盒 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (system tables + query history + Spark UI). Exceptionally rich system schema: system.billing.usage (DBU consumption line items — joinable to price lists to comp…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (system tables + query history + Spark UI).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Exceptionally rich <code>system</code> schema: <code>system.billing.usage</code> (DBU consumption line items — joinable to price lists to compute spend), <code>system.access.audit</code> (auditing), <code>system.query.history</code> (query history and durations) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Spark UI / Ganglia for job execution internals (stages, shuffles, GC); SQL warehouses expose query history and plans <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cost observability is mandatory, not optional: DBUs show consumption without explaining &quot;why&quot; — without tags plus <code>system.billing.usage</code> analysis and per-team chargeback, the invoice is a black box <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__6": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">BI/应用走 SQL Warehouse：标准 JDBC/ODBC、Python SQL 连接器；Serverless SQL 仓库免运维、自动启停 官方文档。 编程入口：REST API、Databricks Connect（本地 IDE 连远程集群）、各语言 SDK；Notebook 支持 Python/SQL/Scala/R 多语言…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>BI/应用走 SQL Warehouse：标准 JDBC/ODBC、Python SQL 连接器；Serverless SQL 仓库免运维、自动启停 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>编程入口：REST API、Databricks Connect（本地 IDE 连远程集群）、各语言 SDK；Notebook 支持 Python/SQL/Scala/R 多语言协作 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无传统&quot;连接池打爆&quot;问题：连接本身轻量，瓶颈在计算资源（DBU）配额与并发 slot；SQL 仓库的并发靠自动扩缩容 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (SQL warehouses over JDBC/ODBC + REST + notebooks). BI/applications connect via SQL warehouses: standard JDBC/ODBC and the Python SQL connector; serverless SQL …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (SQL warehouses over JDBC/ODBC + REST + notebooks).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>BI/applications connect via SQL warehouses: standard JDBC/ODBC and the Python SQL connector; serverless SQL warehouses need no ops and start/stop automatically <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Programmatic access: REST API, Databricks Connect (local IDE to remote cluster), SDKs in multiple languages; notebooks support collaborative Python/SQL/Scala/R <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No classic &quot;connection pool exhaustion&quot; problem: connections are lightweight; the bottleneck is compute (DBU) quota and concurrency slots, with SQL-warehouse concurrency handled by autoscaling <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__7": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Delta Lake 在对象存储上实现 ACID：事务日志 + 乐观并发控制，多写者并发写同一表由协议仲裁 官方文档。 默认隔离级别为可串行化（Serializable）；支持 MERGE、UPDATE、DELETE 等 DML，schema 强制与演进 官方文档。 注意：这是&quot;分析型事务&quot;（ETL 写入、 slowly changing…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Delta Lake 在对象存储上实现 ACID：事务日志 + 乐观并发控制，多写者并发写同一表由协议仲裁 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>默认隔离级别为可串行化（Serializable）；支持 <code>MERGE</code>、<code>UPDATE</code>、<code>DELETE</code> 等 DML，schema 强制与演进 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>注意：这是&quot;分析型事务&quot;（ETL 写入、 slowly changing dimensions），不是 OLTP 行级锁；高频小事务写入会有小文件与日志膨胀问题 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Delta Lake ACID, serializable by default). Delta Lake implements ACID on object storage via transaction log + optimistic concurrency; concurrent writers to the…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Delta Lake ACID, serializable by default).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Delta Lake implements ACID on object storage via transaction log + optimistic concurrency; concurrent writers to the same table are arbitrated by the protocol <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Default isolation is serializable; <code>MERGE</code>, <code>UPDATE</code>, <code>DELETE</code> DML plus schema enforcement and evolution are supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Note: these are analytical transactions (ETL writes, slowly changing dimensions), not OLTP row locking; high-frequency micro-transactions create small-file and log-bloat problems <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__8": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">对外复制/共享：Delta Sharing 开放协议，可把实时表安全共享给外部组织（对方用任意引擎读），无需复制数据 官方文档。 云内高可用：数据在云存储上天然多 AZ 冗余；计算无状态，挂了重拉 社区共识。 无内置的跨区主动-主动复制：多 Region 部署的数据同步与一致性要自己设计（存储复制 + 作业调度），跨区 egress 费用…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>对外复制/共享：Delta Sharing 开放协议，可把实时表安全共享给外部组织（对方用任意引擎读），无需复制数据 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>云内高可用：数据在云存储上天然多 AZ 冗余；计算无状态，挂了重拉 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>无内置的跨区主动-主动复制：多 Region 部署的数据同步与一致性要自己设计（存储复制 + 作业调度），跨区 egress 费用是隐藏大头 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (Delta Sharing outward; no built-in cross-region active-active). Outbound replication/sharing: the Delta Sharing open protocol securely shares live ta…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (Delta Sharing outward; no built-in cross-region active-active).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Outbound replication/sharing: the Delta Sharing open protocol securely shares live tables with external organizations — recipients read with any engine, no data copying <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>In-cloud HA: data on cloud storage is multi-AZ redundant by construction; compute is stateless and re-provisioned on failure <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>No built-in cross-region active-active replication: multi-region data sync and consistency are yours to design (storage replication + job scheduling), and cross-region egress fees are a major hidden cost <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__9": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">经典集群：按任务队列在 min/max worker 区间自动扩缩；实例池（Instance Pools）缩短冷启动 官方文档。 Serverless 计算：免集群管理、秒级启动、按实际用量计费，是 2025 年后官方主推方向 官方文档。 边缘真相：自动扩缩的上下限配得太宽会&quot;易上难下&quot;，缩容滞后吃掉 DBU；Photon/Serverl…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>经典集群：按任务队列在 min/max worker 区间自动扩缩；实例池（Instance Pools）缩短冷启动 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Serverless 计算：免集群管理、秒级启动、按实际用量计费，是 2025 年后官方主推方向 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>边缘真相：自动扩缩的上下限配得太宽会&quot;易上难下&quot;，缩容滞后吃掉 DBU；Photon/Serverless 缩短的是 wall-clock，不是单价 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (autoscaling + serverless elasticity). Classic clusters autoscale workers within min/max bounds driven by the task queue; instance pools shorten cold starts (of…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (autoscaling + serverless elasticity).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Classic clusters autoscale workers within min/max bounds driven by the task queue; instance pools shorten cold starts <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Serverless compute: no cluster management, fast startup, pay-for-what-you-use — the official strategic direction since 2025 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Edge truth: autoscaling bounds set too wide scale up easily and down slowly, burning DBUs while shrinking; Photon/Serverless shorten wall-clock time, not unit price <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>"});